e TRIBES community, ensuring an experience that honors the series' legacy while introducing fresh elements to keep gameplay exciting and engaging. <strong><i>GIFs created by: chickenNwaffles, Colonel Blair, Howsya.</i></strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687970/extras/ad57c45575ac14eb04dc128d13dd4312.poster.avif?t=1731076036\" width=578 height=248 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687970/extras/ad57c45575ac14eb04dc128d13dd4312.webm?t=1731076036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687970/extras/ad57c45575ac14eb04dc128d13dd4312.mp4?t=1731076036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>CUSTOM MATCHES &amp; MODES</strong>: Custom matches allow players to select from a variety of maps, adjust their team sizes, and configure game settings such as player health, energy, thrust, and gravity.<br><br><strong>Buy now to experience the world's fastest shooter game, Shazbot!</strong>",
    "short_description": "TRIBES 3: Rivals is a team-based first person shooter that elevates the genre with jetpacks, skiing, and class-based warfare. Teamwork, tactics, high speed, and intense combat are supreme in this rebirth of the world\u2019s fastest shooter.",
