    "reviews": "\u201cThere\u2019s something about over-the-top, old-school shooters that you just won\u2019t find in AAA FPSs today, and that\u2019s perhaps best exemplified by the likes of the Tribes series...there\u2019s a whole lot to like about its unique, refreshingly over-the-top action\u201d<br>IGN<br><br>\u201cFrom what I played, Tribes 3 can definitely bring back happy memories of zipping around, nicking flags and copping Spinfuser blasts, and the finished article may well have the chops to create some new ones\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cAll the best, most basic zones of your mammalian brain will light up like starshine\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br>",
